<title>USA: IMM currency futures close higher.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures close higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>Feb 24 - IMM currency futures closed higher, as the market corrected steep losses. March sterling gravitated higher, hitting $1.6360, near the 100-day moving average of $1.6364. Marks and yen trimmed gains, but March marks held above $0.5970, or key dollar support at 1.6770. ((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
